    desc='How money works in a Newfoundland and Labrador separation or divorce: equal division of matrimonial assets and the matrimonial home under the Family Law Act, exclusions, common-law couples, the two-year deadline, support and tax.',
    about=['Newfoundland and Labrador divorce', 'matrimonial assets', 'matrimonial home', 'spousal support', 'Family Law Act'],
